            "action_name": {
              "value": "Swarming Bites"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "Each enemy in the swarm's space takes 7d8 piercing damage (39 basic Fortitude save). A creature that fails its save against Swarming Bites becomes clumsy 1 for 1 round (1 minute on a critical failure). If the creature attempts a concentrate or manipulate action while affected, it must succeed at a DC 5 flat check or the action is lost; roll the check after spending the action, but before any effects are applied."
